	)
	(text "GPIO3 is a strapping pin (JTAG source select) and ESP_I2S_SD is\ndriven by the Flight Computer, which is unpowered while the Out\nComputer boots. R34 gives the pad a defined level at reset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 161.925 139.7 0)
		(effects
